{"url": "https://x.com/BlakeKing777/status/2101471915114180715", "id": "2101471915114180715", "text": "My Grok Bot (@bot) is not a chat toy. It is how Schedule Drop got built and shipped.\n\nRyan App Shop (my app-builder bot) designed and coded the phone app with me. Schedule Drop is live in Google Play Closed testing. Fans pick schools and sports, get calendar feeds, and get Phone Alerts when a schedule drops or a game time changes. A Cloudflare Worker handles the quiet background checks. No model call on every tick.\n\nThat is Bot integrated into real work: ship the app, test on Galaxy and iPhone, push store builds, keep alerts honest. @grok\n\nRyan's shareable template:\nhttps://x.ai/bot/SUVGlpw-FxBi2BjnIHWGx", "raw_text": {"text": "My Grok Bot (@bot) is not a chat toy. It is how Schedule Drop got built and shipped.\n\nRyan App Shop (my app-builder bot) designed and coded the phone app with me. Schedule Drop is live in Google Play Closed testing. Fans pick schools and sports, get calendar feeds, and get Phone Alerts when a schedule drops or a game time changes. A Cloudflare Worker handles the quiet background checks. No model call on every tick.\n\nThat is Bot integrated into real work: ship the app, test on Galaxy and iPhone, push store builds, keep alerts honest. @grok\n\nRyan's shareable template:\nhttps://t.co/xC1NIcFzMQ", "display_text_range": [0, 596], "facets": [{"type": "mention", "indices": [13, 17], "original": "bot", "id": "2085838061347217408"}, {"type": "mention", "indices": [539, 544], "original": "grok", "id": "1720665183188922368"}, {"type": "url", "indices": [573, 596], "original": "https://t.co/xC1NIcFzMQ", "replacement": "https://x.ai/bot/SUVGlpw-FxBi2BjnIHWGx", "display": "x.ai/bot/SUVGlpw-Fx\u2026"}]}, "author": {"screen_name": "BlakeKing777", "url": "https://x.com/BlakeKing777", "id": "1518973522378375168", "followers": 2063, "following": 855, "likes": 63836, "media_count": 1703, "name": "Blake King", "description": "\ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8